# Recycle source and license notice

The bounded entry recycle/history implementation is source-assisted by KeePass2.61.1, Copyright Dominik Reichl and the KeePass contributors, GPL-2.0-or-later. Existing runtime/source copyright notices remain intact. No upstream executable/DLL is an application dependency.

The [exact released GPL license](results/history-followup/stage/independent-failure/original-baseline-v2/source/Docs/License.txt.snapshot.snapshot.snapshot) is18,710 bytes, SHA256 `05646d0e8b70da13b0c0d81aaba2c0526be2e8ffdbcb7322d9c4061d27e2143e`. The [source provenance](results/recycle-followup/evidence-blobs/4e77711ca189c8104568b74bd8ba983ca43a5b18ecf0a341d1bdfe8e9a26fd48.snapshot) binds16 full selected files and [contract spans](results/recycle-followup/evidence-blobs/5c8524cfb11b341205d2671569ed062ee0f90b17bad7a192d398602b24225949.snapshot) bind12 selective study contracts from source ZIP SHA256 `711bd9ec7076661678469e51bae876debac07a08c32f1b1c6b3b8fe5e761c13a`. These selective contracts do not replace the complete manual inventory or close its gaps.

