The source-composed oracle and deterministic clock adaptation are test scaffolding. Finite actual released library/helper executions are reported separately from source-only study and GUI executions0. The original executable and full source archive remain local acquisition artifacts. Public source snapshots keep their complete attribution/license bytes and are inert.
